1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,128
Why did Ganesh Ji skip the whole earth, and circle only his parents?

2
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:08,796
One day, Shiv Ji and Mata Parvati said to their two sons,

3
00:00:08,876 --> 00:00:13,240
Whoever goes around the whole earth three times and returns first, will be the winner.

4
00:00:13,553 --> 00:00:17,160
Kartikeya Ji at once sat on his peacock and flew off into the sky.

5
00:00:17,753 --> 00:00:20,827
Ganesh Ji looked at his own vahan, a tiny mouse.

6
00:00:21,007 --> 00:00:23,742
On it, even one round would take years.

7
00:00:24,053 --> 00:00:25,584
But Ganesh Ji did not panic.

8
00:00:25,664 --> 00:00:28,061
He closed his eyes and thought calmly.

9
00:00:28,653 --> 00:00:32,478
Then he folded his hands and walked three times around his parents.

10
00:00:34,187 --> 00:00:37,442
When Kartikeya Ji returned, Ganesh Ji was already sitting there.

11
00:00:37,672 --> 00:00:41,251
Ganesh Ji said, for me, my mother and father are my whole world.

12
00:00:41,481 --> 00:00:44,651
Shiv Ji smiled and declared Ganesh Ji the winner.

13
00:00:45,733 --> 00:00:46,146
The lesson.

14
00:00:46,426 --> 00:00:48,958
Our parents are our first world.

15
00:00:49,238 --> 00:00:53,877
And where strength falls short, find a way with wisdom.

16
00:00:54,487 --> 00:00:59,126
If you want to watch stories like this every day, and learn something new,

17
00:00:59,206 --> 00:01:03,069
then Like the video, Share it, and do Subscribe to the channel.

18
00:01:03,149 --> 00:01:04,767
See you in the next story!
